### Criar funil
POST {{base_url}}/api/funnels
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Funil Trabalhista",
  "descricao": "Funil para leads de direito trabalhista"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("funnel_id", response.body.id);
%}

### Listar funis do tenant
GET {{base_url}}/api/funnels
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}

### Buscar funil por ID
GET {{base_url}}/api/funnels/{{funnel_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}

### Editar funil
PUT {{base_url}}/api/funnels/{{funnel_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Funil Trabalhista v2"
}

###

### Adicionar coluna ao funil
POST {{base_url}}/api/funnels/{{funnel_id}}/columns
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Novo Lead",
  "ordem": 1,
  "tipo": "inicial",
  "cor": "#3B82F6"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("column_id", response.body.id);
%}

### Listar colunas do funil
GET {{base_url}}/api/funnels/{{funnel_id}}/columns
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}

### Reordenar colunas
PUT {{base_url}}/api/funnels/{{funnel_id}}/columns/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "order": ["col_id_1", "col_id_2", "col_id_3"]
}

###

### Listar leads do funil
GET {{base_url}}/api/funnels/{{funnel_id}}/leads?page=1&per_page=50
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}

### Buscar lead por ID
GET {{base_url}}/api/leads/{{lead_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}

### Mover lead entre colunas (manual)
PUT {{base_url}}/api/leads/{{lead_id}}/move
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "column_id": "{{target_column_id}}"
}

### Mover lead para outro funil
PUT {{base_url}}/api/leads/{{lead_id}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "funnel_id": "{{target_funnel_id}}"
}

### Histórico de movimentações do lead
GET {{base_url}}/api/leads/{{lead_id}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}
